WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:02.240
- Hey, guys, my name is Heinrich

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:04.070
and welcome to Firm Learning.

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:05.240
I'm a little bit excited

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:08.420
because this is my very
first video on this channel

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:10.443
and I would like to use
it as an introduction

00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:13.920
of what you can expect if
you subscribe to my channel

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:17.820
and look at all the future
videos that I'm going to upload.

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:19.240
I'm Heinrich, I'm from Germany

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:22.720
and my passion has always
been business and management.

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:24.210
I would like to use this channel

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:25.773
to reflect on my experiences

00:00:25.773 --> 00:00:29.850
and share what I have
learned in the last years.

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:32.304
My professional background
is management consulting.

00:00:32.304 --> 00:00:34.081
I've worked for over six years

00:00:34.081 --> 00:00:38.040
for a large, leading, top
management consulting firm

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:40.730
and now recently transitioned
to a role in industry,

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:44.550
now working for a large
German fashion retailer.

00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:46.780
This channel is going to
be especially targeted

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:50.150
towards new people just
being in the labor market

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:52.890
for a couple of years,
young professionals,

00:00:52.890 --> 00:00:54.890
or people who are going to join

00:00:54.890 --> 00:00:58.320
the very first job they're
going to have very soon.

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:01.950
Some things I will cover are,
for example, meeting behavior.

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:04.680
How can I behave at the
very best in the meeting

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:06.380
if I'm only a junior colleague?

00:01:06.380 --> 00:01:08.070
Or having tough conversations

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:11.630
with some other work colleagues
or maybe even my boss.

00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:13.920
Or what to do if you
make a mistake at work,

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:15.720
what to do about it, how to do that.

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:18.430
But also topics covering mindset issues

00:01:18.430 --> 00:01:20.490
and other things that might hold you back

00:01:20.490 --> 00:01:23.350
in order to be successful in your career.

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:25.714
Before working, I studied
business and philosophy

00:01:25.714 --> 00:01:29.740
here in Munich but also in other
universities across Europe.

00:01:29.740 --> 00:01:32.920
These have been some pretty
formative years for me as well

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:35.980
which will also heavily
influenced how I see things,

00:01:35.980 --> 00:01:37.490
what my perception is,

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:40.600
what perspective I have that
I want to bring across to you.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:41.690
Besides all of this,

00:01:41.690 --> 00:01:44.004
I would also like to use
this channel as a playground

00:01:44.004 --> 00:01:47.420
to learn about social
media, learn about YouTube

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:49.260
and other platforms like that,

00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:52.730
so hanging with me here, let's
not take this too seriously,

00:01:52.730 --> 00:01:53.828
I'm sharing a few thoughts

00:01:53.828 --> 00:01:56.470
and hopefully we are all
gonna learn from that.

00:01:56.470 --> 00:01:59.140
Of course, I'm very much
open for your suggestions.

00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:00.820
I would like to hear from you

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:03.560
what topics around these things
you would be interested in,

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:05.660
ask me question, set me up via email

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:06.919
or in the comments below

00:02:06.919 --> 00:02:09.520
and of course subscribe to this channel

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:12.977
to not miss out any opportunity.

00:02:12.977 --> 00:02:15.010
Of course, over time I will also work

00:02:15.010 --> 00:02:16.260
on improving the equipment

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:18.064
to make this a more
professional experience

00:02:18.064 --> 00:02:20.070
for everybody involved,

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:22.430
so hang in there here with me as well,

00:02:22.430 --> 00:02:24.830
the audio quality will improve over time.

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:26.573
Thank you for watching
this very first video.

00:02:26.573 --> 00:02:30.553
I will be posting new videos
soon so let's get started.

